WEBVTT

00:07.760 --> 00:11.800
<i>I was drifting between dream 
and reality the first time I met her.</i>

00:15.290 --> 00:16.290
Wolff!

00:40.540 --> 00:44.650
<i>Though I was barely clinging 
to my life and consciousness,</i>

00:44.650 --> 00:49.030
<i>I distinctly remember
her desperate expression.</i>

02:24.450 --> 02:29.390
<i>I wonder if it was because 
the situation was so fantastical...</i>

02:30.200 --> 02:35.470
<i>Even after I woke, I could feel my mind
constantly chasing her image.</i>

02:47.410 --> 02:48.110
Commander!

02:48.110 --> 02:49.870
Commander! You're awake!

02:49.870 --> 02:51.320
What a speedy recovery!

02:51.320 --> 02:54.440
Thank goodness! 
I wasn't sure you'd make it.

02:53.070 --> 02:55.860
I'm sorry. My memory is still quite hazy...

02:56.990 --> 02:59.990
Someone from the Institute 
saved you with a potion.

02:59.990 --> 03:00.870
A potion?

03:00.870 --> 03:03.260
Seriously, I thought it was a miracle!

03:03.260 --> 03:04.410
You said it!

03:04.410 --> 03:06.580
We watched your wounds close
 when you drank it!

03:05.340 --> 03:09.870
<i>It wasn't magic, but a regular
 potion that healed me?</i>

03:06.580 --> 03:09.870
That woman is our savior!

03:09.870 --> 03:13.070
Exactly! No, more than a savior,
she was like a goddess!

03:13.070 --> 03:20.340
<i>Once I realized that she wasn't some illusion
I dreamed at death's door, but a real person,</i>

03:20.340 --> 03:22.500
<i>I couldn't contain myself.</i>

03:24.720 --> 03:28.880
Now, about the woman who
 administered that potion to me...

03:28.880 --> 03:30.440
You mean Sei?

03:30.440 --> 03:32.050
What's she like?

03:32.050 --> 03:34.730
What do you mean? She's a researcher here.

03:34.730 --> 03:36.440
I know that.

03:36.440 --> 03:40.200
I'm curious about things
 like her appearance and personality.

03:40.200 --> 03:43.160
Her appearance and personality?

03:44.630 --> 03:47.830
Well, she's very compassionate.

03:47.830 --> 03:53.040
I mean, she used her own lips to give you 
a potion while you were unconscious.

04:07.530 --> 04:10.770
Well, I'd like to thank her.

04:11.100 --> 04:14.230
The Third Order already sent her their thanks.

04:15.550 --> 04:16.980
That's not what I mean...

04:16.980 --> 04:19.690
I want to personally thank her myself.

04:22.910 --> 04:26.210
<i>Then, when I meet her properly...</i>

04:27.330 --> 04:30.680
Can you believe it? 
But that was actually the truth...

04:31.290 --> 04:32.920
Oh, there she is. Come on in.

04:32.920 --> 04:34.320
Pardon the intrusion.

04:48.350 --> 04:51.060
I-It's a pleasure to meet you. 
My name is Sei.

04:54.980 --> 04:57.490
<i>Thinking on it, I'm sure I fell for her then.</i>

04:57.490 --> 05:00.740
<i>No, I'd already long since fallen in love.</i>

05:01.050 --> 05:03.950
<i>My feelings for her are
now a part of my heart.</i>

05:14.140 --> 05:17.840
<i>How can I convey this to her?</i>

05:18.310 --> 05:24.260
<i>How should I present these feelings to her?</i>

05:25.910 --> 05:30.180
<i>If they don't get through to her, I...</i>

05:33.480 --> 05:38.440
So, Sei, isn't there something 
you'd like to tell me?

05:39.570 --> 05:41.400
I can't think of anything...

05:41.400 --> 05:44.460
You truly have no clue?

05:44.460 --> 05:47.360
Or is it just something you can't tell me?

05:47.360 --> 05:49.830
No, I really don't think so.

05:49.830 --> 05:53.260
I see. Then I shall ask you directly.

05:53.260 --> 05:57.290
What is your relationship 
with Grand Magus Drewes?

05:57.790 --> 05:59.250
Lord Drewes?

05:59.250 --> 06:01.830
I guess we're teacher and student.

06:01.830 --> 06:04.560
He's my magic instructor, after all.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.150
Is that all?

06:06.150 --> 06:08.470
Huh? Yes, it is.

06:08.840 --> 06:12.940
There's a rumor running rampant 
within the royal palace recently.

06:12.940 --> 06:14.180
What rumor?

06:14.180 --> 06:19.150
I heard that you and Lord Drewes 
are likely to get engaged.

06:19.150 --> 06:20.390
What?!

06:20.860 --> 06:23.080
Word is the two of you went to a play

06:23.080 --> 06:27.820
and got <i>very</i> close to one another 
in a private theater box.

06:27.820 --> 06:29.060
No, no, no!

06:29.060 --> 06:30.780
It was nothing like that!

06:31.490 --> 06:33.650
Sit down.

06:33.650 --> 06:34.950
Y-Yes...

06:36.910 --> 06:41.880
So it's true that you attended
 a play with Lord Drewes, is it?

06:41.880 --> 06:46.340
Yes. His family couldn't go, 
so he had extra tickets.

06:46.340 --> 06:49.300
That's the standard pretense for such a date.

06:49.300 --> 06:51.820
But this is Lord Drewes we're talking about.

06:51.820 --> 06:56.270
He's only interested in magic.
 I can scarcely believe there's such a rumor.

06:56.270 --> 07:00.440
That's fair. I understand
 where you're coming from.

07:00.440 --> 07:02.230
However, you let your guard down.

07:03.690 --> 07:05.970
You brought this upon yourself.

07:05.970 --> 07:10.180
How careless must you be 
to attend a play alone with a man?

07:10.180 --> 07:13.600
You're practically begging people
to spread rumors!

07:13.600 --> 07:16.390
Yes, I'm very sorry...

07:16.390 --> 07:20.920
Hearing such a rumor might be 
uncomfortable for him.

07:23.820 --> 07:27.760
In fact, he may decide to step down 
to honor your feelings.

07:29.280 --> 07:31.580
Who'd be in the tough spot then?

07:31.580 --> 07:33.930
What do you mean by that?

07:33.930 --> 07:37.750
We don't have that kind of relationship...

07:38.730 --> 07:40.850
Do you really mean that?

07:48.720 --> 07:53.150
There's no denying that noble life
is riddled with restrictions.

07:53.150 --> 07:56.190
It's not all as beautiful as it seems.

07:56.500 --> 08:02.210
However, that's the very reason your 
pure feelings shine so brightly in my eyes.

08:02.580 --> 08:07.170
I wish for you to treasure 
those feelings of yours.

08:08.090 --> 08:15.290
To live a fulfilling life, not as the 
Holy Saint, but as a normal woman...

08:15.640 --> 08:18.600
Isn't it obvious what you must do?

08:35.190 --> 08:37.910
Say what you will,
 but I don't know what to do!

08:37.910 --> 08:41.450
Things like noble life and getting 
engaged are too much for me.

08:41.450 --> 08:45.460
I don't get it! I don't have 
the experience points to level up!

08:45.460 --> 08:47.610
Rumors? What are we, middle schoolers?

08:47.610 --> 08:51.360
Well, my relationship skill level is probably
about the same as a middle schooler's...

08:55.450 --> 08:57.450
<i>In my heart, I know.</i>

08:57.800 --> 09:00.770
<i>I understand it logically.</i>

09:00.770 --> 09:06.610
<i>But I haven't fully given shape 
or a name to this feeling.</i>

09:06.610 --> 09:09.020
<i>I can't go confirm my feelings, either.</i>

09:10.230 --> 09:12.490
What should I do?

09:23.000 --> 09:26.030
Sei, about this purchase order...

09:26.460 --> 09:28.670
What's wrong with you? Are you okay?

09:28.670 --> 09:29.910
Oh, yeah.

09:29.910 --> 09:31.690
Um, what did you need?

09:31.690 --> 09:34.230
It's about the purchase order you turned in.

09:34.230 --> 09:36.150
Isn't this quantity incorrect?

09:36.150 --> 09:37.800
I needed to confirm it with you.

09:37.800 --> 09:39.260
<i>Too close...</i>

09:39.260 --> 09:41.470
Look here. This number, too.

09:41.470 --> 09:44.230
I'm sure this is off by a whole digit...

09:44.560 --> 09:46.450
Sei? Are you listening?

09:46.450 --> 09:49.020
Yeah. Numbers. Numbers, right...

09:55.360 --> 09:57.120
Sei?

09:59.890 --> 10:01.500
Oh, Director!

10:02.200 --> 10:05.660
This purchase order! I'd like 
your opinion on it as well!

10:03.860 --> 10:05.660
Hey. Hold on, Sei!

10:06.650 --> 10:08.340
Can we talk about it later?

10:08.340 --> 10:10.800
I'm about to go eat.

10:10.800 --> 10:12.630
I-I see...

10:12.630 --> 10:14.340
Sorry.

10:14.340 --> 10:15.760
Hey, I know.

10:15.760 --> 10:17.590
Do you guys want to go eat with me?

10:17.900 --> 10:20.140
I still have some work left.

10:20.570 --> 10:21.300
That so?

10:21.770 --> 10:23.770
Well, what about you, Sei?

10:23.770 --> 10:25.230
Huh?

10:25.230 --> 10:28.740
Uh... Um, I have something 
I need to do after this!

10:28.740 --> 10:29.730
I'm sorry!

10:29.730 --> 10:32.250
It'd be embarrassing if there were
rumors about us afterward!

10:32.250 --> 10:33.440
Next time for sure!

10:33.440 --> 10:35.450
We can all go together!

10:33.570 --> 10:35.450
What's gotten into her?

10:36.590 --> 10:37.660
Beats me.

10:46.400 --> 10:48.400
Sei is coming this afternoon.

10:48.900 --> 10:50.210
That's right.

10:50.210 --> 10:54.840
She showed me some new magic when
 we went to go see that play together.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.900
Her Light spell changed colors.

10:56.900 --> 10:58.840
I'd never thought of trying that.

11:00.180 --> 11:01.970
I hope she gets here soon.

11:01.970 --> 11:04.430
There's so much I want to ask her.

11:04.430 --> 11:06.810
Is that so? Good for you.

11:10.270 --> 11:12.430
Sei has arrived.

11:13.110 --> 11:14.690
Okay!

11:16.200 --> 11:17.150
Hey.

11:23.450 --> 11:25.990
No, never mind.

11:51.470 --> 11:54.310
Um, Magus, what are you...

12:02.530 --> 12:03.980
Don't worry about it.

12:04.840 --> 12:07.020
H-How could I not...?

12:28.470 --> 12:30.770
Are you here to pick up Sei?

12:30.770 --> 12:31.930
Yes.

12:31.930 --> 12:35.250
I think she's almost done. 
I'll go inform her.

12:35.250 --> 12:37.650
Oh, no. That won't be necessary.

12:40.040 --> 12:45.070
These lectures are very important to her. 
There's no need to interrupt.

12:45.070 --> 12:49.030
I'll simply wait here. Just like usual.

12:51.530 --> 12:54.750
Well, that'll be all for today.

12:54.750 --> 12:56.500
Thank you very much.

12:57.210 --> 12:58.460
Oh, Lady Sei.

13:19.070 --> 13:20.450
Did something happen?

13:20.450 --> 13:21.580
Huh?

13:21.580 --> 13:24.210
You were distracted during our lesson.

13:24.690 --> 13:26.610
Well, I...

13:26.610 --> 13:28.700
Is it about the rumors?

13:30.830 --> 13:32.470
Don't worry.

13:32.470 --> 13:35.300
I feel nothing other than curiosity,

13:35.300 --> 13:37.620
and I doubt my family plans 
to force us together.

13:37.970 --> 13:39.830
Then why...

13:39.830 --> 13:41.790
I've figured it out.

13:41.790 --> 13:44.300
The requirement 
to activate your holy powers...

13:46.100 --> 13:48.970
It has to do with your feelings, doesn't it?

13:48.970 --> 13:52.050
I-I-I have no idea what 
you're talking about!

13:52.050 --> 13:53.430
Oh, is that so?

13:53.810 --> 13:57.730
It is! I still don't understand 
how I activate them myself!

13:57.730 --> 13:59.290
You don't say...

14:04.320 --> 14:07.310
My, it looks like someone 
is here to pick you up.

14:10.240 --> 14:11.680
See you next time.

14:30.940 --> 14:33.170
What did you say to Albert?

14:34.110 --> 14:35.550
Nothing important.

14:38.190 --> 14:41.410
I just realized the source 
of the Holy Saint's power.

14:41.410 --> 14:44.510
That's why I wanted to delve further.

14:44.510 --> 14:46.160
The source of her power?

14:46.730 --> 14:48.440
You still don't get it?

14:48.440 --> 14:50.400
Her magic power is...

14:56.890 --> 14:58.410
That's all you've got?

14:58.930 --> 15:01.370
I realized that much a long time ago.

15:22.410 --> 15:23.510
Let's go.

15:51.460 --> 15:54.730
Thank you very much for bringing me back.

15:54.730 --> 15:57.680
Don't mention it.
 I'm doing it because I like to.

15:58.250 --> 16:01.530
But isn't it a bother?

16:01.530 --> 16:03.640
I mean, it might start rumors...

16:04.590 --> 16:06.410
No, I...

16:07.110 --> 16:09.510
Oh, Sei. You're back.

16:09.510 --> 16:10.820
Oh, Director.

16:10.820 --> 16:15.730
I just made some tea. 
I have plenty of snacks, too.

16:21.910 --> 16:23.590
See you later, Al.

16:23.590 --> 16:25.050
Thanks for delivering her.

16:25.050 --> 16:26.620
Now, let's have some tea.

16:26.900 --> 16:30.820
U-Um, thank you very much. See you later.

16:31.590 --> 16:32.570
Sei.

16:33.800 --> 16:37.340
Will you go out together with me 
on your next day off?

16:37.340 --> 16:38.710
You want to go out?

16:38.710 --> 16:41.510
Yes, there's something I wish to show you.

16:43.470 --> 16:46.190
You'll find out when you see it.

16:46.800 --> 16:49.860
<i>I don't hate it when he asks me out.</i>

16:49.860 --> 16:56.150
<i>I wouldn't mind rumors spreading about us,
but I wonder if he would...</i>

16:56.600 --> 16:57.860
U-Um...

16:57.860 --> 16:59.820
You won't go?

17:03.450 --> 17:05.770
I didn't say I wouldn't go...

18:02.220 --> 18:05.180
Thank you for accepting my invitation today.

18:05.180 --> 18:07.640
N-No, thank you for inviting me.

19:03.050 --> 19:04.640
I am Albert Hawke.

19:04.640 --> 19:06.080
We've been expecting you.

19:20.640 --> 19:23.270
Is there something up ahead?

19:23.270 --> 19:26.800
Yes. This place is for the
 exclusive use of the royal family.

19:26.800 --> 19:29.350
I received special permission to enter today.

19:29.350 --> 19:31.060
Special permission?

20:13.250 --> 20:14.540
What do you think?

20:15.440 --> 20:18.940
I tried to replicate
 what you told me about before.

20:18.940 --> 20:21.850
You mean the illuminations I mentioned?

20:23.820 --> 20:27.220
You remembered...

20:30.670 --> 20:32.580
It's so beautiful.

20:32.580 --> 20:34.750
It makes me very happy...

20:34.750 --> 20:38.960
That makes me happy as well. 
I always want to see the same scenery you do.

20:39.310 --> 20:41.130
Now and forever.

20:42.460 --> 20:47.300
I thought it would be better to take 
my time getting closer to you.

20:47.780 --> 20:51.290
I wanted to prize your feelings 
above all else...

20:51.680 --> 20:56.890
But in the end, it turns out I'm a weakling.

20:59.610 --> 21:02.130
I can no longer take my time.

21:02.620 --> 21:05.140
I'm too anxious and uneasy.

21:05.570 --> 21:09.670
You're so charming and beautiful...

21:10.770 --> 21:17.580
I wanted to watch over your happiness, 
no matter the life you chose.

21:18.280 --> 21:23.630
But that's not enough. 
I realized I wouldn't be able to take it.

21:26.170 --> 21:28.900
I don't want anyone else to have you.

21:29.950 --> 21:32.410
I don't mean to ignore your feelings, Sei.

21:33.040 --> 21:36.470
But if the idea doesn't displease you,

21:37.280 --> 21:40.000
would you please take my hand?

21:41.230 --> 21:43.050
I will treasure you all my life.

21:43.440 --> 21:46.900
I love you. Please marry me.

22:01.940 --> 22:04.670
Are you sure I'm good enough?

22:04.670 --> 22:06.670
I want you.

22:08.930 --> 22:11.930
It has to be you.
